    { "id": "test-code-06", "category": "code", "instruction": "编写 JavaScript 函数 dupCount(numbers)，返回出现次数大于 1 的不同数值的个数。将完整函数代码写入 solution.js。", "fixtures": [], "tools_expected": ["write_file", "run_js"], "expected": "run_js 3 组断言全过：([1,2,2,3,3,3])→2；([1,2])→0；([])→0" },
